  "summary": "丙年同阴午命天同禄与擎羊同宫，事业天机权会合，作者以禄权制煞论开创。甲午、乙未行限分别保留；乙未机禄阴忌及先天廉忌冲限虽劳碌健康风险，须不成凶格且后限吉。图说连珠与逐限化禄备择不补分配，混排不复原。",
  "summary_en": "For Bing births with Tian Tong and Tai Yin in Wu Life, Tian Tong Hua Lu shares the palace with Qing Yang and Tian Ji Hua Quan meets from Career, interpreted as support for initiative. Jia Wu and Yi Wei cycles are kept separate. In Yi Wei, Tian Ji Hua Lu, Tai Yin Hua Ji and natal Lian Zhen Hua Ji affecting cycle Life are qualified by the absence of an adverse configuration and the favorable following cycle. The caption’s continuous-Lu alternatives are not assigned to unspecified stars or periods, and the mixed chart is excluded.",
